Kept for reproducing the 2026-08-11 m3_ios_realdevice demo only.
That demo links a foreign prebuilt libdart_aotruntime_product.a whose loader
wants KBC v02. The VM in ~/dart/sdk wants v01
(runtime/vm/constants_kbc.h:245), so do NOT apply this for X1 work.

Apply with:  git -C ~/dart/sdk apply archive/route_a/dbc_v02.patch

diff --git a/pkg/dart2bytecode/lib/dbc.dart b/pkg/dart2bytecode/lib/dbc.dart
--- a/pkg/dart2bytecode/lib/dbc.dart
+++ b/pkg/dart2bytecode/lib/dbc.dart
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@ library;
 
 /// Version of bytecode format
 /// (should match runtime/vm/constants_kbc.h).
-const int bytecodeFormatVersion = 1;
+const int bytecodeFormatVersion = 2;
 
 enum Opcode {
   kTrap,
